* Toppar stream file generated by FFParam cgenfftoconverter
* For use with Drude force field
*

ioformat extended

read rtf card append
* Topologies generated by FFParam cgenfftoconverter
* For use with Drude force field
*
44

AUTO ANGL DIHE DRUD

! Converts cgenff atomtype to drude atom types.
! Charges are picked from cgenff stream file
! Alpha and Thole values are picked from first match of atom type in a text file containing all currently available residues.
! If it cannot find the values -1.0 and -1.3 values are assigned to the atom type.

RESI  r125      0.0000
GROUP
ATOM  C1     CD31A     0.019  ALPHA   -1.593  THOLE    0.714
ATOM  F1     FDA1     -0.106  ALPHA   -0.879  THOLE    1.336
ATOM  H      HDA1A     0.184
ATOM  F2     FDA1     -0.106  ALPHA   -0.879  THOLE    1.336
ATOM  C2     CD30A     0.423  ALPHA   -1.227  THOLE    0.047
ATOM  F3     FDA3     -0.138  ALPHA   -0.821  THOLE    0.464
ATOM  F4     FDA3     -0.138  ALPHA   -0.821  THOLE    0.464
ATOM  F5     FDA3     -0.138  ALPHA   -0.821  THOLE    0.464

BOND C1  F1 
BOND C1  H 
BOND C1  F2 
BOND C1  C2 
BOND C2  F3 
BOND C2  F4 
BOND C2  F5 

END


read param card append
* Parameters generated by FFParam cgenfftoconverter
* For use with Drude force field
*

! Parameters are picked from same text file containing all currently available parameters.
! Similar approach like cgenff is applied, but it is not checked for its robustness.

BONDS
!CD31A   FDA1   200.000   1.365   ! from CD32A SD2C2B  QM
CD31A   CD30A  222.500   1.500   ! from CD31A CD31A  PENALTY  2.000
!CD30A   FDA3   200.000   1.351   ! from CD32A SD2C2B  QM

ANGLES
!FDA1   CD31A   HDA1A   25.000  109.686   ! from SD2C2B CD32A HDA2A  PENALTY 23.000
!FDA1   CD31A   FDA1   90.000   108.779   ! from OD305A CD31FA OD31E  PENALTY 155.000
FDA1   CD31A   CD30A   43.000  108.540   ! from CD32A CD32A SD31B  PENALTY 363.000
HDA1A   CD31A   CD30A   34.500 111.569   ! from CD31A CD31A HDA1A  PENALTY 98.000
CD31A   CD30A   FDA3   43.000  109.666   ! from CD32A CD32A SD31B  PENALTY 28.000
!FDA3   CD30A   FDA3   45.000   108.370   ! from OD305A CD30FA OD31E  PENALTY 157.000

DIHEDRALS
FDA1   CD31A   CD30A   FDA3   0.438  1  -61.527   ! from OD31A CD32A CD30FA OD31E  PENALTY 161.000
FDA1   CD31A   CD30A   FDA3   0.587  2  179.588   ! from OD31A CD32A CD30FA OD31E  PENALTY 161.000
FDA1   CD31A   CD30A   FDA3   0.382  3  59.025   ! from OD31A CD32A CD30FA OD31E  PENALTY 161.000
FDA1   CD31A   CD30A   FDA3   0.127  6  -179.596   ! from OD31A CD32A CD30FA OD31E  PENALTY 161.000
HDA1A   CD31A   CD30A   FDA3   0.050  2  60.000   ! from SD31B CD32A CD32A HDA2A  PENALTY 477.000
HDA1A   CD31A   CD30A   FDA3   0.120  3  -60.000   ! from SD31B CD32A CD32A HDA2A  PENALTY 477.000
HDA1A   CD31A   CD30A   FDA3   0.270  1  180.000   ! from SD31B CD32A CD32A HDA2A  PENALTY 477.000

IMPROPERS


END
